<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A2" title="In ArGen: Auto-Regulation of Generative AI via GRPO and Policy-as-Code" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref"><span class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">B</span> </span><span class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">Detailed Framework Comparison</span></span></a>
