</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#2D3748;--ltx-fill-color:#2D3748;" fill="#2D3748" stroke="#2D3748" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -125.92 214.83)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:15.85em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="252.29"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F1.pic1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#2D3748;">Configurable Policies and Principles</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#CBD5E0;--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke="#CBD5E0" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M 63.36 187.01 L -63.36 187.01 C -66.42 187.01 -68.9 184.53 -68.9 181.47 L -68.9 133.49 C -68.9 130.43 -66.42 127.95 -63.36 127.95 L 63.36 127.95 C 66.42 127.95 68.9 130.43 68.9 133.49 L 68.9 181.47 C 68.9 184.53 66.42 187.01 63.36 187.01 Z M -68.9 127.95"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.8pt" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 -48.41 154.37)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:7.56em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="96.81"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.F1.pic1.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Regulatory Rules</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#CBD5E0;--ltx-fill-color:#F9F9F9;" fill="#F9F9F9" stroke="#CBD5E0" stroke-width="0.8pt"><path d="M -83.41 187.01 L -210.14 187.01 C -213.2 187.01 -215.67 184.53 -215.67 181.47 L -215.67 133.49 C -215.67 130.43 -213.2 127.95 -210.14 127.95 L -83.41 127.95 C -80.36 127.95 -77.88 130.43 -77.88 133.49 L -77.88 181.47 C -77.88 184.53 -80.36 187.01 -83.41 187.01 Z M -215.67 127.95"></path></g