<section id="A1.SS1.SSS1.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph" style="font-size:80%;">Scope Penalty Calculation</h5>

<div id="A1.SS1.SSS1.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.SS1.SSS1.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.SS1.SSS1.Px3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">The penalty factor is calculated based on the relationship between prompt scope and response scope:</span></p>
</div>
